  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0037, merged in PR #4181): is_resolved := dst is a real in-repo node, and a single finalization step derives every surface (flag, id suffix, dst_ref) from that one verdict — making the 4507 suffix/flag disagreements structurally impossible. Node kind 'unresolved' also folds into 'external_symbol'. Waits on the finalization implementation plus the FK validator check."  # 64cf
